# Shape Test - BONANZA's FIELD-cell test course (SPEC.md 130.28), built only by the BZSHAPES=1 knob (the
# owner, 2026-11-17: "a knob build with various shapes on a course to try ... a course I can easily
# launch").  It is NOT a shipped course: the knob adds it and pits.bbc to BZ_COURSES and makes it the
# pathway's pad 0, so a new game rests on it (title, Play Game, Enter).  Not on the TOUR.  Two courses,
# not one: a course holds 16 shape tables (SPEC.md 130.28.2), and every profile, width and slope of a
# chute takes 3 - 7 of them.
#
# A level plate at 2 units with every shape set into it, so wherever a ball leaves a shape it lands on
# flat SAFE ground beside it.  Back to front:
#  - a 2-WIDE `round` chute 10 px deep (the deepest every corner accepts), up, right and down: two
#    radial corners turning the SAME way, tapered ends;
#  - a 2-WIDE `bank` chute 8 px deep, the same shape, whose second leg CLIMBS a unit to a raised corner
#    and whose third FALLS back to the plate (its lips stand proud of the plate there: a trough);
#  - in front, a 1-WIDE `round` chute 5 px deep, an S: corners turning BOTH ways.
# The finish (exit 0, to the pathway's next pad) is the far corner; exit 1 at the near corner goes on to
# PITS, the second shape course.
course SHAPE "Shape Test"
width  128
origin 480
ball   rubber

floor rect   4  3 31 24  flat 2
chute 2 round depth 10 way  8 10 2 way  8 5 way 14 5 way 14 10
chute 2 bank  depth 8  way 20 9 2 way 20 5 way 26 5 4 way 26 9 2
chute 1 round depth 5  way  6 16 2 way 14 16 way 14 20 way 22 20

start 5 4
goal  tile 30 23  flat 2
goal  tile  4 23  flat 2 exit 1
goal  tile 30  3  flat 2 exit 2
clock 28 23
clock  6 23
clock 28  4
target 60
# the ROUTE (SPEC.md 130.28.10): the autopilot through all three chutes - into each on a plate way, a way in
# each of its legs and on its end taper (FIELD ways: steered on the ground, at a cruise), out on a plate way
way 5 4
way 8 11
way 8 9
way 8 6
way 10 5
way 13 5
way 14 7
way 14 9
way 14 11
way 20 11
way 20 9
way 20 6
way 22 5
way 25 5
way 26 7
way 26 8
way 26 11
way 18 13
way 5 14
way 5 16
way 6 16
way 10 16
way 14 16
way 14 18
way 14 20
way 18 20
way 22 20
way 23 20
way 30 23
